<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 892 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 892 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 892 contracts compared to 1,278 overnight Sunday.</p>
<p>There were 50 wheat, 387 corn, 388 soybean, 44 soymeal, 18 soyoil and five soybean call contracts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was steady to one cent higher, corn was unchanged to 3/4 cent higher and soybens were 1/4 cent higher to 3/4 cent lower.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
